{"turn_id": "d11-t1", "session_id": "d11", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "num_models", "text": "论文使用两个已发表的图像描述模型进行训练和评估，两个模型都采用编码器-解码器架构。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "models_used", "text": "使用的两个模型是Neural Image Captioning（NIC）模型和Yunjey的Pytorch-tutorial图像描述模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}, {"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-721ac9d3e099bacb12ac84aa"}]}, {"key": "architecture_cnn_rnn_lstm", "text": "在架构上，CNN首先用于编码器部分提取图像特征，得到的向量特征用于解码层；解码器部分使用RNN-LSTM将向量映射为目标句子。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "show_and_tell", "text": "实验结果显示中，NIC模型也被称为Show and Tell模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-721ac9d3e099bacb12ac84aa"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d11-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d11-t2", "session_id": "d11", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "two_models", "text": "论文训练并评估了两个采用编码器-解码器架构的已发表图像描述模型：Neural Image Captioning（NIC）模型，以及 Yunjey 的 Pytorch-tutorial 图像描述模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "architecture", "text": "在架构上，CNN 首先用于提取图像特征作为编码器部分，这些以向量表示的特征随后用于解码；解码器部分使用 RNN-LSTM 将向量嵌入为目标句子。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "metrics", "text": "论文使用 BLEU、ROUGE 和 CIDEr 指标，在 NIC 模型与 Pytorch-tutorial 图像描述模型之间进行验证与比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-94b848c452b3746ffb5c659d"}]}, {"key": "training_sets", "text": "这两个模型分别在三个数据集上训练：English-sportball、GT-sportball 和 UIT-ViIC；训练后，每个数据集使用验证子集中的 924 张图像对模型进行验证。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-721ac9d3e099bacb12ac84aa"}]}, {"key": "two_existing_models", "text": "结论部分说明，作者在两个流行的已有图像描述模型上进行了多项实验，以评估它们在两个越南语数据集上的学习效率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-df82acb31723d02ba4213f1a"}]}, {"key": "show_and_tell_naming", "text": "实验结果部分将这两个模型称为“Pytorch-tutorial”和“NIC - Show and Tell”模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-721ac9d3e099bacb12ac84aa"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d11-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
